1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,093
Combine f equals v over lambda with v equals root T over mu.

2
00:00:06,093 --> 00:00:12,356
The n th mode has frequency n over two L, times root T over mu.

3
00:00:12,356 --> 00:00:18,385
Every whole number works, so unlike a closed pipe, a string gives every harmonic.

4
00:00:18,385 --> 00:00:21,184
That is why a plucked string sounds so rich.

